  "assumptions": [
    "A published normalized binding-profile ratio is transferred as a relative association-affinity multiplier; the original normalization pipeline is not fully recovered.",
    "The same chosen GLI profile scales activator and repressor affinity. GLI2 is primary; GLI3 is a sensitivity analysis.",
    "A nine-base site is assigned to a published Nkx2.2 regulatory context. Other enhancer sequence, chromatin and cofactors are fixed and unmodelled.",
    "Reporter mode reads promoter occupancy on an unchanged endogenous trajectory. Endogenous mode is a hypothetical genomic edit with feedback.",
    "Signal is the Gli activator fraction A in [0,1]; repressor fraction R=1-A. It is not a calibrated Shh concentration.",
